.TH PRODIGY-AP-REVEAL 1 "2026-08-29" "GWAY local tools" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
prodigy-ap-reveal \- rotate and show the local AP password
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B prodigy-ap-reveal
.RI [ --dry-run ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B prodigy-ap-reveal
rotates the local AP password with
.IR /usr/local/sbin/prodigy-ap-password ,
reapplies the
.B PRODIGY
NetworkManager AP profile, which broadcasts
.B arthexis-1
by default, with
.IR /usr/local/bin/prodigy-nmcli ,
and then displays the saved password on the local LCD using
.IR prodigy-password-lcd-60s .
.PP
On success, the command prints the new password to standard output.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B --dry-run
Validate helper paths, sudo availability, and LCD-helper inputs without
rotating the password or writing the LCD event.
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B PRODIGY_AP_PASSWORD_TOOL
Override the password rotation helper. Defaults to
.IR /usr/local/sbin/prodigy-ap-password .
.TP
.B PRODIGY_AP_NMCLI_TOOL
Override the PRODIGY NetworkManager wrapper. Defaults to
.IR /usr/local/bin/prodigy-nmcli .
.TP
.B PRODIGY_AP_LCD_TOOL
Override the LCD password display helper. Defaults to
.IR /home/arthe/.local/bin/prodigy-password-lcd-60s .
.TP
.B PRODIGY_AP_PROFILE
Override the NetworkManager connection profile. Defaults to
.BR PRODIGY .
.TP
.B PRODIGY_AP_SSID
Override the broadcast SSID. Defaults to
.BR arthexis-1 .
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR prodigy-password-lcd-60s (1),
.BR rfid-arm-next-script (1)
